//- THE ASSISTANT'S TYPING ROW - LIVES AT THE LOG'S LIVE END WHILE A TURN IS
//- IN FLIGHT; THE ASSISTANT PUSH DELETES IT BY ID (aiChatPush.pug). WEARS
//- THE MIRROR'S OWN THINKING TREATMENT (.chatMessageText.empty + .ellipsis,
//- SEE chat/message/messageTyping.pug). RENDERED AS A MIXIN SO THE FULL
//- SECTION RENDER AND THE WS PUSH SHARE ONE SHAPE.
mixin aiChatTyping(app, threadId, icon)
  .chatMessageRow.aiChatRow.botMsg.aiTypingRow(id=`ai-typing-${threadId}`)
    .chatContentContainer
      if icon
        img.userAvatar.chatAuthorAvatar(src=icon alt="" referrerpolicy="no-referrer")
      .chatMessageContent
        .chatAuthor
          b.chatAuthorUsername= app.display_name
          .chatMessageTag.aiTag AI
        .chatMessageText.empty
          .ellipsis
            div
            div
            div
          | #{app.display_name} is thinking...
